<title>VATICAN: Vatican minister to pay state visit to Kuwait.</title>
<headline>Vatican minister to pay state visit to Kuwait.</headline>
<dateline>VATICAN CITY 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Vatican said on Wednesday its foreign minister would make a state visit to Kuwait, its first at such a senior level.</p>
<p>Chief Vatican spokesman Joaquin Navarro-Valls said Monsignor Jean-Louis Tauran would leave for Kuwait on Thursday. The visit was expected to last several days.</p>
<p>Tauran was expected to meet local Roman Catholic leaders and Kuwaiti officials and to discuss the situation of the Church in Kuwait.</p>
</text>
